{"id":"steam-773180","steam":773180,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"PsyX","summary":"You think you're the hero of an action movie. But you're just an ordinary person who doesn't realize they're stuck in a cheap zombie horror built from bugs, copy-paste, and someone else's laziness. The game is about to beat you.","about":"What if I told you your entire life is just a cheap indie horror game?\n\nHave you ever wondered why everything around you is so absurd? Why the world barely works? Why every problem shows up exactly when the plot needs it to?\n\nMaybe it's because there is no world.\n\nThere's only a story that someone wrote for you.\n\nA dark comedy about identity, free will, and some truly awful game design.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/7912540dd117a3337192db8e8d53318704e7b238/library_capsule.jpg?t=1781875562","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/3447b2e46cff83165ec9e0321d731eb01f24cccb/header.jpg?t=1781875562","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/3638098d1a47fe4aabb1494924d5b220e16ff615/library_hero.jpg?t=1781875562","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/3447b2e46cff83165ec9e0321d731eb01f24cccb/header.jpg?t=1781875562","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/6044a002cd558a003d667b2bf9852760945ea9ee/ss_6044a002cd558a003d667b2bf9852760945ea9ee.600x338.jpg?t=1781875562","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/6044a002cd558a003d667b2bf9852760945ea9ee/ss_6044a002cd558a003d667b2bf9852760945ea9ee.jpg?t=1781875562"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/82ff54fc8bea2b9040606358b4a2472dff837f53/ss_82ff54fc8bea2b9040606358b4a2472dff837f53.600x338.jpg?t=1781875562","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co